...................................................................................CURIA1|202|FIN|1|2zzzzz
CURIA1|202|END|3
# Frame 203: a good frame after the overlong lines.
CURIA1|203|BEGIN|0|0.1.0|1066|9|15|1001|Test Ruler One
CURIA1|203|END|2
